      },
      "numberInSurah": 62,
      "juz": 7,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 135,
      "ruku": 109,
      "hizbQuarter": 54,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 852,
      "text": "Say, “Who rescues you from the darkness of the land and sea? You invoke Him humbly and privately[21], ‘If only He rescues us from this, we will certainly be among those who are grateful.’”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 6,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنۡعَامِ",
        "englishName": "Al-An'aam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cattle",
        "numberOfAyahs": 165,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 63,
      "juz": 7,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 135,
      "ruku": 109,
      "hizbQuarter": 54,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 853,
      "text": "Say, “Allah rescues you from it and from every distress, yet you associate partners with Him.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 6,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنۡعَامِ",
        "englishName": "Al-An'aam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cattle",
        "numberOfAyahs": 165,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 64,
      "juz": 7,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 135,
      "ruku": 109,
      "hizbQuarter": 54,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 854,
      "text": "Say, “He is Capable of sending a punishment from above you or from beneath your feet, or split you into factions, and make you suffer at the hands of one another.” See how We diversify the signs, so that they may understand.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 6,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنۡعَامِ",
        "englishName": "Al-An'aam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cattle",
        "numberOfAyahs": 165,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 65,
      "juz": 7,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 135,
      "ruku": 109,
      "hizbQuarter": 54,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 855,
      "text": "But your people [O Prophet] have rejected this [Qur’an] although it is the truth. Say, “I am not a keeper over you.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 6,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنۡعَامِ",
        "englishName": "Al-An'aam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cattle",
        "numberOfAyahs": 165,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 66,
      "juz": 7,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 135,
      "ruku": 109,
      "hizbQuarter": 54,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 856,
      "text": "Every matter has an appointed time, and you will soon come to know.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 6,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنۡعَامِ",
        "englishName": "Al-An'aam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cattle",
        "numberOfAyahs": 165,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 67,
      "juz": 7,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 135,
      "ruku": 109,
      "hizbQuarter": 54,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 857,
      "text": "When you see those who ridicule Our verses, turn away from them until they engage in another discourse. If Satan should make you forget, then as soon as you remember, do not remain with the wrongdoing people.",
      "surah": {
